{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"standards\": [\n    {\n      \"std\": \"1\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"只读线就能看清一个人从想靠近、害怕暴露，到逐渐承认自己的感情、面对失去的可能，最后接受不确定性的完整经历；没有依赖珠子补充事件或把音乐画面翻译成真实经历。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"2\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"内在发展有清楚的递进：最初怕自己的需要成为负担，后来怕对方不再需要自己，再到意识到自己愿意付出、无法保证长久，最终选择不再隐藏。几次不安的回返都有新的认识，不是原地打转。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"3\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"整件事始终围绕亲密带来的幸福，以及越珍惜越害怕留不住的痛楚展开，没有偏离Center。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"4\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"各段主要体验都能在同段线中找到相近的心理处境，尤其是亲近、克制、失去支撑、孤独、渴望、舍不得和最终接受不确定性；珠子对应的线编号也完整明确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"底线\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"线的意思整体清楚，人物的心理和前后关系没有足以让下一步照着读歪的歧义。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"std\": \"形态\",\n      \"verdict\": \"过\",\n      \"note\": \"分段、每段的Center关系标注、前文出处标注和珠子对应编号均齐全，线的各条内容也都是可以独立理解的完整表达。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"issues\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "184a923f-1eea-4065-95fe-5c658fd6dbfc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T175607589959Z", "elapsed_seconds": 353.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T18:02:01.198385+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9dc3356e097754fe533b35c32c4bb6880231d193f0871535ae09ae663c5dcfc5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb